Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:42.40,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.53,0:01:46.87,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.41,0:01:49.15,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.17,0:01:51.92,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.92,0:01:54.14,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.42,0:01:59.14,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:03.31,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.10,0:02:08.47,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:08.10,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.27,0:02:12.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:11.93,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:12.59,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:13.76,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:18.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.10,0:02:17.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:18.07,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:19.31,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.36,0:02:23.83,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:27.25,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:29.13,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:30.50,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.10,0:02:33.03,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:32.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:36.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:35.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:38.70,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.30,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Everybody Yes, Huslte！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.43,0:02:41.01,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,心跳不已  喜笑颜开
