Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:30.53,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,摆动身体跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:34.37,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:34.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,沐浴在阳光下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.16,0:22:37.62,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,今天也整日闪亮动人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:39.71,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,all right ！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:40.90,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,加油~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.06,0:22:41.70,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,努力~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:42.82,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转换好心情~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.82,0:22:43.74,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Ei~Ei~Oh！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:45.32,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:48.09,OP＆ED,,0,0,20,,碰壁了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:48.76,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Crash on！
